            "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:18:07.761469+00:00",
            "notes": "Unless you put up Celtics Shaq numbers last round, you should at least be able to afford either [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and/or [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) to farm more damage and more money. [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) is particularly useful for the increased range on your primary fire, which can help against [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18), [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424), and others that you may need to put pressure on from afar. The increase in attack speed is great too, considering how slow Sigma's rate of fire is. \n\nIf you're a bit short on money, grab [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) instead of [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) (or grab both if you have a lot of money). If you need to sell something to afford one of these Rare items, try not to sell [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf).\n\nLike last round, play to your strengths and farm as much money as you can.",
