            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:18:07.761469+00:00",
            "notes": "Increase your survivability more by getting [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). With this and the healing you get from your barriers, you'll be healing yourself for 9% of your Max Life! \n\nIf you're not facing a ton of pressure or if you're feeling confident, pick up [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95) instead for some juicy extra damage. If you want to meet in the middle between offense and sustain, [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) can be helpful by boosting your damage while also gaining valuable lifesteal. It can be strong against the likes of [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) and [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) who don't have as many tools as other tanks to avoid getting hit by your primary fire. Do your best to keep your distance from them, though, to optimize your gains (and honestly keep your distance between these tanks in general, since they can be a bit difficult to deal with up close).\n\nLike last round, fill your empty item slots with more WP and/or attack speed.",
