            "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:18:07.761469+00:00",
            "notes": "You have some flexibility now when picking a Power this round. You definitely want something to increase your offensive presence, as the enemy team can easily trample you with enough pressure. \n\nFor most matchups, getting [Trinisphere](item_ffaf0527-137c-4fa6-8048-82f2c99f6d56) is a solid choice to easily increase your damage output. With this Power, upgrade [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) with [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95) to make it easier for you to deal damage if you miss directs hits or when targeting large groups. [Apogee Alignment](item_b2792d32-5b21-40df-9c71-be2ac3a59f27) can also be useful here for putting easy pressure on those who are really in your face.\n\nAn alternative route to go is to build more into Accretion with [Singularity](item_d5c3fffb-e066-4078-a4e5-a5ab383856f4), which is useful against the likes of [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) and [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6). It's an overall solid pick if your team needs some crowd control or if some of the enemy team likes to play out of position. If you do go this route, get [The Harness](item_f076e6bc-f185-437a-bbc3-e599919990c8) instead of [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95). You don't have to put too much money into AP since your best pressure tool is still your primary fire. Items that give both WP and AP such as [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) are good options here, though.\n\nRegardless of what path you take, if you're against heroes like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) that may build heavily into attack speed, also consider getting [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) now or later, since them rushing you down can be very overwhelming.",
