            "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:18:07.761469+00:00",
            "notes": "[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) has the added benefit of helping you reposition a bit if you're in a sticky situation and have to use Kinetic Grasp or Accretion. [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) complements well with your primary fire's quick bursts of damage. If you're still short on money at this point, do the best you can to maximize your damage output with what you can afford.\n\nI've only tried a couple of powers in the this round with varying success. Some of those include [Event Horizon](item_01720c0d-74a0-4c6a-8f75-c9e1fe908186) and [Astrophysical](item_7749452f-3c0e-45a9-9c32-f561aa7fb41e), and both of them seemed to have some good to them for their own reasons (increasing your barriers' uptimes for the former and giving yourself a \"get off me\" tool for the latter). [Apogee Alignment](item_b2792d32-5b21-40df-9c71-be2ac3a59f27) might also be able to work if they're really in your face.",
